  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Family",
     "texto": [
      "**Aile** means «family». The possessive is attached to the noun: **annem** (my mother), **babam** (my father), **kardeşim** (my brother or sister).",
      "The suffix for «my» is usually **-(I)m**; it takes a linking vowel when the noun ends in a consonant: **evim** (my house).",
      "**Ailem** means «my family». **Kim?** means «who?»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
